WEBVTT

00:01.543 --> 00:02.877
Here I come,

00:03.086 --> 00:06.131
rushing in like a boar!

00:07.173 --> 00:08.508
I'm pissed.

00:08.675 --> 00:09.968
I'm so damn pissed.

00:15.598 --> 00:17.726
Teruko, hang on to the furniture.

00:19.686 --> 00:21.521
That demon is a caster.

00:21.604 --> 00:23.982
You can't just slash him with a sword.

02:07.460 --> 02:11.965
I'm so pissed off by these stinking bugs
messing around in my house.

02:26.437 --> 02:28.314
The room can spin.

02:28.398 --> 02:31.651
Interesting!

02:35.446 --> 02:37.615
Don't step on another person.

02:40.660 --> 02:42.537
What the hell?

02:43.288 --> 02:46.541
You just stepped on a child.
What's up with you?

02:49.294 --> 02:50.837
Good.

02:51.087 --> 02:54.799
That was the first time
someone threw me down.

02:56.801 --> 02:58.469
Why is he fighting me?

02:58.720 --> 03:00.221
Is he not a Demon Slayer?

03:00.847 --> 03:03.182
My swords are amazing, aren't they?

03:03.558 --> 03:06.936
They are not for ordinary kids like you.

03:07.937 --> 03:11.691
They can make mincemeat out of anybody.
They're my pride and joy.

03:11.941 --> 03:12.942
Stop.

03:13.026 --> 03:14.485
The demon is over there.

03:15.028 --> 03:16.112
I don't care!

03:17.572 --> 03:18.823
Stinking bugs.

03:19.073 --> 03:21.409
Get out of my sight and die!

03:25.663 --> 03:27.457
The tatami got split open.

03:28.082 --> 03:30.084
It happened at the same pace
as the drum beat.

03:30.752 --> 03:33.087
It looks like a scratch of a wild animal.

03:37.550 --> 03:38.593
Go right.

03:40.637 --> 03:41.846
Go left.

03:42.305 --> 03:43.473
Stupid bug.

03:44.390 --> 03:45.767
You damn stinking bugs!

03:51.356 --> 03:53.024
I'm getting the hang of it.

03:59.489 --> 04:01.241
The room is changing again.

04:01.950 --> 04:03.493
But how did that happen?

04:04.118 --> 04:06.371
The demon didn't beat his drum.

04:07.413 --> 04:10.541
I can smell a few demons in this mansion.

04:11.334 --> 04:13.461
Are there other demons beating drums?

04:14.671 --> 04:15.838
That might explain why...

04:19.175 --> 04:20.301
I smell blood.

04:22.220 --> 04:23.346
Don't be afraid.

04:24.180 --> 04:25.765
Stay behind me.

04:35.566 --> 04:37.944
It's the leftovers of another corpse
eaten by a demon.

04:39.404 --> 04:41.030
What is it?

04:41.781 --> 04:42.907
It's okay.

04:43.157 --> 04:44.450
The demon is not here anymore.

04:44.951 --> 04:46.536
Come on, let's go somewhere else.

04:48.454 --> 04:51.457
Don't turn around, walk straight ahead.

04:55.670 --> 04:57.755
There's another scent,
but it's not from a corpse.

04:58.298 --> 05:01.634
It's the smell of a peculiar blood
I've never encountered before.

05:02.719 --> 05:04.512
But it's not a big spill.

05:35.710 --> 05:37.503
Excuse me, Mr. Zenitsu.

05:44.927 --> 05:47.805
Signal.

05:47.889 --> 05:49.807
Whatever you do, give me a signal.

05:49.891 --> 05:52.393
If you want to say something,
don't do it so suddenly.

05:52.477 --> 05:56.022
I'm so shocked,
I almost threw up my heart.

05:57.231 --> 05:58.524
Sorry.

05:58.858 --> 06:04.405
If my heart blasted out,
you'll become a murderer, get it?

06:04.739 --> 06:06.115
I was just saying...

06:06.699 --> 06:09.702
that you sweat a lot, breathe heavily,
and tremble terribly.

06:09.786 --> 06:10.828
Can't I?

06:10.912 --> 06:13.289
I already did my best!

06:14.207 --> 06:16.751
No, I'm sorry to say this,

06:16.876 --> 06:19.170
but your jitters are making me uneasy too.

06:19.253 --> 06:21.380
No, I'm sorry!

06:21.881 --> 06:23.716
But...

06:23.883 --> 06:28.930
If we don't stop talking,
the demon might show up.

06:29.263 --> 06:33.184
So I want to be as quiet as possible.

06:33.267 --> 06:34.352
What about you?

06:42.652 --> 06:44.195
There are kids.

06:44.362 --> 06:46.697
Boy, do they taste good.

06:47.615 --> 06:49.117
Look at that!

06:49.367 --> 06:52.203
It showed up, right? Isn't that a demon?

06:55.081 --> 06:56.374
Stay away from me!

06:56.457 --> 06:57.667
Don't come after me!

06:57.750 --> 07:00.253
Stop chasing me, I said!

07:02.797 --> 07:04.590
I'm not tasty!

07:04.674 --> 07:06.300
I'm definitely not tasty!

07:06.384 --> 07:07.426
Really!

07:07.510 --> 07:11.973
We're skinny, dry, sunken,
and definitely not tasty!

07:13.808 --> 07:16.811
You will never know if you haven't tried.

07:19.814 --> 07:20.940
What the hell?

07:21.023 --> 07:23.443
His tongue is so fast,
it split the bucket into two!

07:25.528 --> 07:27.655
This is ridiculous!

07:27.822 --> 07:29.240
No!

07:31.701 --> 07:33.703
Get up, Mr. Zenitsu.

07:34.579 --> 07:35.705
My knees won't take orders.

07:35.788 --> 07:38.249
Eighty percent of my fear
is concentrated in them.

07:38.416 --> 07:41.127
This is not the time
to talk stuff like that.

07:41.210 --> 07:44.255
Just leave me alone.

07:44.338 --> 07:45.923
You have to run.

07:46.007 --> 07:47.717
But I can't.

07:49.469 --> 07:51.304
He's such a good boy.

07:51.471 --> 07:53.890
I can tell from his voice
that he's scared.

07:54.932 --> 07:56.851
I have to think of something.

07:57.435 --> 08:00.438
It's a pity if I can't protect him.

08:00.521 --> 08:03.441
It isn't right if he dies young.

08:03.774 --> 08:05.693
But I'm extremely feeble.

08:05.776 --> 08:06.736
Get up.

08:06.819 --> 08:09.280
I may not be strong enough,

08:09.655 --> 08:11.908
but I must protect him.

08:14.911 --> 08:19.916
I'm going to slurp the bone marrow
out of your ear.

08:24.670 --> 08:25.922
Mr. Zenitsu!

08:26.797 --> 08:27.757
Sir...

08:32.720 --> 08:33.971
He's asleep.

08:36.891 --> 08:38.726
What's up with him?

08:51.447 --> 08:52.657
You're finished!

08:53.866 --> 08:57.912
Mr. Zenitsu, get up now!

09:29.527 --> 09:32.029
What's that sound?

09:32.321 --> 09:35.616
His breath, it has changed.

09:36.826 --> 09:38.327
Mr. Zenitsu?

09:41.914 --> 09:43.416
Breath of Thunder.

09:43.624 --> 09:44.750
First Form.

09:45.459 --> 09:46.794
Thunderclap and Flash.

10:07.607 --> 10:09.025
It's dead!

10:09.191 --> 10:11.152
The demon's suddenly dead!

10:11.235 --> 10:12.194
But how?

10:12.278 --> 10:13.571
I can't take it!

10:13.654 --> 10:15.531
What happened?

10:15.615 --> 10:16.616
I can't take it anymore!

10:19.785 --> 10:23.039
Shoichi, did you...

10:24.457 --> 10:27.126
Thank you for saving me!

10:27.209 --> 10:29.837
I'll appreciate it forever!

10:29.920 --> 10:33.841
You should've told me
that you were so powerful!

10:36.218 --> 10:37.803
What's up with him?

10:39.180 --> 10:40.389
What was that?

10:41.932 --> 10:42.975
Nothing.

10:46.103 --> 10:47.271
Nothing.

10:47.897 --> 10:49.231
Let's go.

10:52.109 --> 10:54.362
I've lost him again.

10:54.945 --> 10:57.114
It has been like this
in the past three days.

10:57.198 --> 10:58.157
Damn it.

10:58.574 --> 11:01.744
Rushing through a building so narrow,

11:02.119 --> 11:04.580
I'm so not in my element!

11:12.922 --> 11:14.507
You dodged.

11:14.590 --> 11:17.426
You're one pretty vigorous human being.

11:18.886 --> 11:22.681
Looks like you're worthy of me
shredding you into pieces.

11:27.937 --> 11:30.606
My way, the Breath of the Beast.

11:31.107 --> 11:35.027
The larger the target,
the better it is to split into two!

11:36.153 --> 11:39.740
You have such guts to rush towards me.

11:42.576 --> 11:45.329
That hurts!

11:45.788 --> 11:49.667
I'm going to make a stepping stone
out of your corpse.

11:50.334 --> 11:51.710
Third Fang.

11:51.794 --> 11:53.087
Rip and Devour!

12:00.803 --> 12:03.889
Rushing in like a boar!

12:08.352 --> 12:11.355
Rare blood.

12:11.647 --> 12:13.274
I can only eat rare blood.

12:14.442 --> 12:15.860
So I'll reach the power of 50...

12:16.318 --> 12:18.362
No, I mean 100 people.

12:19.864 --> 12:23.659
I must eat more people with rare blood.

12:24.034 --> 12:25.411
Once I do,

12:26.412 --> 12:29.582
I can rejoin the Twelve Demon Moons.

12:40.259 --> 12:41.469
Kyogai.

12:43.929 --> 12:45.806
You can't eat any more people?

12:46.682 --> 12:48.392
Is this all you can do?

12:48.851 --> 12:51.729
No, this isn't it.

12:56.859 --> 12:58.360
Please wait a little longer.

12:58.736 --> 13:00.362
Give me a little more time.

13:00.446 --> 13:01.655
That's enough.

13:02.239 --> 13:04.492
I'm going to strip you of your number

13:04.950 --> 13:07.536
because you've reached your limit.

13:09.455 --> 13:12.208
The more people you eat,
the mightier you become.

13:12.875 --> 13:18.214
Only by fulfilling that criteria,
will I obtain the blood of Lord Kibutsuji.

13:19.715 --> 13:23.177
The lord's blood contains power
beyond compare.

13:23.886 --> 13:28.140
No matter how strong I get,
I still couldn't catch up with him.

13:28.557 --> 13:31.227
In order to rejoin the ranks
of the Twelve Demon Moons,

13:31.727 --> 13:34.188
I had to keep on devouring more people.

13:34.271 --> 13:37.942
I believed that I can still be
even more powerful.

13:39.902 --> 13:41.654
So I believed.

13:43.072 --> 13:44.698
Kiyoshi!

13:47.326 --> 13:49.703
Kiyoshi!

13:50.746 --> 13:51.830
Teruko.

13:54.166 --> 13:55.543
Who is this?

13:56.502 --> 13:58.128
I'm Tanjiro Kamado.

13:58.837 --> 14:00.631
I'm here to defeat evil demons.

14:02.424 --> 14:04.218
Here, let me see your injury.

14:04.802 --> 14:06.512
You did well even when you were alone.

14:09.682 --> 14:10.933
Kiyoshi.

14:16.939 --> 14:19.400
Here's an amazing wound cream.

14:19.608 --> 14:22.027
My master made it for me.

14:23.279 --> 14:26.657
My master always wears a tengu mask.

14:27.032 --> 14:28.909
Tengu? Really?

14:29.159 --> 14:30.244
Yes.

14:30.619 --> 14:34.790
His cream is so amazing,
it works the second you rub it.

14:36.500 --> 14:37.751
There you go.

14:38.836 --> 14:41.005
Well, it doesn't hurt, right?

14:44.425 --> 14:47.094
Can you tell me what you encountered here?

14:50.890 --> 14:52.808
A monster caught me.

14:54.768 --> 14:56.353
As he was about to eat me,

14:58.147 --> 15:01.942
some other monsters came out of nowhere.

15:03.319 --> 15:05.029
They started fighting each other.

15:06.196 --> 15:10.492
They were arguing
over who among them could eat me.

15:11.744 --> 15:16.582
Then, there was one
who grew drums on his body.

15:17.583 --> 15:19.960
When the others beat him up,

15:20.461 --> 15:22.212
this drum fell off him.

15:23.631 --> 15:26.926
I picked it up and beat it,
and the room changes.

15:28.010 --> 15:29.637
I still have it now.

15:32.765 --> 15:34.808
The one with the drums.

15:35.100 --> 15:36.185
Is it that one?

15:37.061 --> 15:40.856
The one who talks about rare blood?

15:42.316 --> 15:43.943
Yes, that's the one.

15:44.318 --> 15:46.278
He keeps calling me rare blood.

15:48.614 --> 15:53.077
This so-called "rare blood"
refers to someone with precious blood.

15:56.747 --> 15:58.123
You brats.

15:58.207 --> 15:59.917
Watch out or I'll peck your heads.

16:00.167 --> 16:01.251
Stop it.

16:02.127 --> 16:04.713
What do you mean by precious blood?

16:05.047 --> 16:09.301
Every living being
has its own type of blood, you fool.

16:09.551 --> 16:11.136
Amongst rare blood,

16:11.220 --> 16:15.891
there's an even rarer precious blood
that gives even greater power.

16:16.016 --> 16:19.853
To demons,
a person with rare blood has the worth

16:20.145 --> 16:24.817
that is equivalent of 50
or even 100 normal people!

16:25.943 --> 16:28.654
Rare blood is the demons'
most exquisite delicacy.

16:28.737 --> 16:30.739
It's the demon's favorite.

16:40.207 --> 16:43.377
Rare blood.

16:45.713 --> 16:47.214
I'm about to leave this room.

16:48.549 --> 16:50.551
Calm down and you'll be all right.

16:51.260 --> 16:52.970
I have demons to slay.

16:54.680 --> 16:55.889
Listen, Teruko.

16:57.433 --> 16:59.852
Your brother here is very tired.

16:59.935 --> 17:01.603
You must be a good girl and help him.

17:03.480 --> 17:04.940
Once I leave,

17:05.024 --> 17:07.151
you must beat the drum
to move the place around.

17:07.609 --> 17:09.528
Just like what your brother did.

17:09.903 --> 17:11.697
Whoever opens the door,

17:11.780 --> 17:15.909
once you hear it,
just beat the drum to save yourselves.

17:16.827 --> 17:18.746
I promise I'll get you out of here.

17:19.371 --> 17:21.081
I'll trace your scent.

17:21.874 --> 17:24.293
When I open the door, I'll call your name.

17:27.671 --> 17:29.548
Just hang in there.

17:30.424 --> 17:31.508
Can you do it?

17:34.678 --> 17:36.764
Good, you're strong.

17:39.975 --> 17:41.018
I'll be back soon.

17:49.693 --> 17:50.652
Beat it!

17:53.238 --> 17:55.032
Stinking bugs.

17:55.324 --> 17:56.950
Such a pain in the ass.

18:13.884 --> 18:16.220
Drum on the right shoulder, turn right.

18:18.097 --> 18:19.640
Drum on the left shoulder, turn left.

18:20.766 --> 18:22.476
Drum on the right leg, move forward.

18:23.102 --> 18:25.354
Drum on the left leg, move back.

18:27.106 --> 18:29.858
Drum on the belly, a scratch!

18:45.916 --> 18:46.917
It's so fast.

18:47.000 --> 18:49.795
His spinning and attacks
are surprisingly quick.

18:50.963 --> 18:53.423
Ms. Tamayo may have treated me a lot,

18:53.590 --> 18:55.300
but my wounds haven't completely healed.

18:57.219 --> 18:59.388
Can I beat him?

19:00.472 --> 19:04.393
My wounds hurt so much, I can't stand it.

19:06.186 --> 19:09.273
I have to endure it.

19:09.815 --> 19:12.943
When I pulled Zenitsu away from that girl

19:13.485 --> 19:15.237
and reprimanded him,

19:15.320 --> 19:17.322
I had to endure a sore so acute.

19:18.157 --> 19:20.325
I'm the eldest son, so I must endure it.

19:21.118 --> 19:23.245
If I were a second son,
I wouldn't have endured it.

19:25.414 --> 19:27.040
If I exert pressure on my leg,

19:27.207 --> 19:30.502
the broken part will make a cracking sound
and I can't make it go up.

19:33.088 --> 19:37.009
The demon's attack
that looks like a scratch mark.

19:37.926 --> 19:40.304
It's stopping me from getting closer.

19:41.805 --> 19:43.682
I'm not in my best condition,

19:43.807 --> 19:46.685
so when I want to charge
by shortening the standoff distance,

19:46.894 --> 19:49.438
my leg won't work with me
because of the pain.

19:52.482 --> 19:53.901
I'll be shredded into pieces.

19:56.528 --> 19:59.448
The agony is only making me
think of the worst.

20:00.324 --> 20:01.658
Master Urokodaki?

20:03.744 --> 20:06.413
Water comes in all shapes and sizes.

20:07.706 --> 20:09.917
In a measuring cube, it's a square.

20:10.334 --> 20:12.336
In a vase, it is round.

20:12.544 --> 20:16.798
Sometimes, it can smash a rock
and spread its pieces all over.

20:17.424 --> 20:19.551
Yes, he's right.

20:20.052 --> 20:23.013
Breath of Water comes in many forms.

20:23.680 --> 20:25.432
So it can take on all sorts of foes.

20:26.558 --> 20:30.145
Even when I'm injured,
I can make up for it with motion.

20:30.520 --> 20:32.314
I can turn into all shapes and sizes.

20:32.940 --> 20:35.150
The flow of water will never stop!

20:38.111 --> 20:41.615
Not only my bones are broken,
but my heart is frustrated.

20:43.158 --> 20:46.328
I can't stand Tanjiro being frustrated!

20:46.703 --> 20:48.789
Can you please be quiet?

20:49.706 --> 20:51.667
I have to move forward.

20:52.209 --> 20:54.044
I'll liven up my own spirits.

20:55.170 --> 20:56.964
Go for it, Tanjiro.

20:57.923 --> 20:59.007
Go for it!

21:03.387 --> 21:05.514
You have come so far.

21:05.973 --> 21:07.641
You can do it.

21:08.308 --> 21:09.810
Be it today

21:10.519 --> 21:11.812
or the days ahead.

21:12.187 --> 21:13.939
No matter how tough it gets,

21:16.358 --> 21:20.153
I'll never give up!

22:52.996 --> 22:55.123
Go, Tanjiro!

22:56.041 --> 22:58.376
I'm the eldest son, so I have to bear it.

22:59.086 --> 23:01.004
You're rooting for me, aren't you?

23:01.088 --> 23:02.214
Thank you, Nezuko.

23:02.964 --> 23:05.592
I'll return your favor
by rooting for you as well.

23:05.675 --> 23:07.427
Go, Nezuko!

23:08.553 --> 23:11.348
You must not give up, Nezuko.

23:12.099 --> 23:13.350
You're the eldest daughter.

23:13.433 --> 23:16.645
No matter how bad it gets,
you must tell me everything.

23:18.230 --> 23:21.441
Next, episode 13,
"Something More Important Than Life."

23:22.150 --> 23:25.529
I didn't take the time
to tell you gossip from the Taisho era!

23:26.905 --> 23:28.198
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.281 --> 23:29.574
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
